  "content": "\n\n<h1>天穹廢墟傳送門 ✨</h1>\n<p><strong>本模組</strong>&nbsp;為《我的世界》新增了<strong>天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>，散佈於<strong>主世界各生物群系與海洋</strong>之中，為<strong>原版遊戲</strong>帶來更豐富的設定🗺️</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/68a4ced6606aaaedb4a0be65ed83e528db6f425b.jpeg\" alt=\"Ruined Aether Portal Promo\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp &copy; - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>注意事項📝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>&nbsp;與<strong>1.20 至 1.21.11</strong>版本<strong>相容</strong>🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>為世界生成新增了<strong>結構體</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>與任何<strong>世界生成模組</strong>皆相容</li>\n<li><strong>天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>已翻譯成超過<strong>20種語言</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>&nbsp;對下載的檔案進行&nbsp;<strong>解壓縮</strong>&nbsp;🗂️</li>\n<li><strong>建議使用耳機</strong>&nbsp;以獲得更佳體驗🎧</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>資訊 🎼</h2>\n<p><strong>本模組</strong>&nbsp;是以下專案的<strong>相容性更新與擴充</strong>&nbsp;<strong>（程式碼貢獻與靈感來源）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ruined-aether-portals-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">天穹廢墟傳送門</a>&nbsp;作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/moralle/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moralle</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252faether-ruined-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">天穹資料包：廢墟傳送門</a>&nbsp;作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fthe-aether-team\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether Team</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>廢墟傳送門生成🌐</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>天穹廢墟傳送門</p>\n<h2>天穹廢墟傳送門變體數量：15</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"Glowstone Dust Item\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af8458e419bf5e19e66d0c9b6d03a007460d6a9e.jpeg\" alt=\"Ruined Aether Portal\"></p>\n<p><strong>天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>生成於<strong>主世界</strong>（主世界海洋生物群系除外），若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>下界天穹廢墟傳送門</p>\n<h2>天穹廢墟傳送門變體數量：14</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"Glowstone Dust Item\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a0565afdff18a95665f2df1ad83276434480c860.jpeg\" alt=\"Nether Ruined Aether Portal\"></p>\n<p><strong>天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>生成於<strong>主世界</strong>（主世界海洋生物群系除外），若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal_nether</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>海洋天穹廢墟傳送門</p>\n<h2>天穹廢墟傳送門變體數量：15</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"Glowstone Dust Item\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df3689fa72ba9cd30fea3d14a40a5c4ab73c276d.jpeg\" alt=\"Ruined Aether Portal Ocean\"></p>\n<p><strong>海洋天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>生成於<strong>所有海洋生物群系</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal_ocean</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>巨型天穹廢墟傳送門</p>\n<h2>天穹廢墟傳送門變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"Glowstone Dust Item\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/11ef842d6b2aa6c21b8095a6ee2fa87525d75c7d.jpeg\" alt=\"Aether Ruined Portals Giant\"></p>\n<p><strong>巨型天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>生成於<strong>主世界</strong>（主世界海洋生物群系除外），若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:giant_ruined_aether_portal</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>海洋巨型天穹廢墟傳送門</p>\n<h2>天穹廢墟傳送門變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"Glowstone Dust Item\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/13fdd787abc35b798ba6bb2a3906f6e60e21dca8.jpeg\" alt=\"Aether Ruined Portals Giant Oceanic\"></p>\n<p><strong>海洋巨型天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>生成於<strong>所有海洋生物群系</strong>，若想透過<strong>指令</strong>尋找，請使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:giant_ruined_aether_portal_ocean</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>新成就 🏆</h2>\n<p><strong>若您發現了天穹廢墟傳送門</strong>，將獲得一個名為<strong>「天堂維度？」</strong>的<strong>新成就</strong>，顯示如下：</p>\n<p>◾&nbsp;<strong>圖片 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"Glowstone Dust Item\">：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3629da067cf457a5ba97f50f13e92b543ec24b6.png\" alt=\"Logros Ruined Portals\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/caa13d665e5bbae5b82f271b571566af42085d2b.png\" alt=\"Logros Ruined Portals\"></p>",
